### Kitchen workflow (run requests.http steps 1-2 first so an order exists and is COMPLETED)

### tokens
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/restaurant/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=restaurant-web&username=chef1&password=password

> {% client.global.set("chef1", response.body.access_token); %}

###
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/restaurant/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=restaurant-web&username=manager1&password=password

> {% client.global.set("manager1", response.body.access_token); %}

###
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/restaurant/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=restaurant-web&username=admin1&password=password

> {% client.global.set("admin1", response.body.access_token); %}

### 1. Chef's board for loc-1 (QUEUED tickets appear after the order saga COMPLETED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/tickets?status=QUEUED
Authorization: Bearer {{chef1}}

> {% if (response.body.length > 0) { client.global.set("ticketId", response.body[0].id); } %}

### 2. Chef starts cooking (WRITE permission: same location + restaurant open + ticket not served)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/tickets/{{ticketId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{chef1}}

### 3. Chef marks it ready
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/tickets/{{ticketId}}/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{chef1}}

### 4. Chef tries to serve -> 403 (SERVE is manager-only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/tickets/{{ticketId}}/serve
Authorization: Bearer {{chef1}}

### 5. Manager serves
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/tickets/{{ticketId}}/serve
Authorization: Bearer {{manager1}}

### 6. Skipping a step -> 409 (start an already served ticket)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/kitchen/tickets/{{ticketId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{manager1}}

### ---- Read model rebuild (CQRS replay), run directly against the services, not through the gateway ----

### R1. Empty the read model (query service)
DELETE http://localhost:8082/admin/read-model
Authorization: Bearer {{admin1}}

### R2. Re-publish every order as an OrderSnapshot (order service)
POST http://localhost:8081/admin/replay/orders?batchSize=500
Authorization: Bearer {{admin1}}

### R3. Compare: orderViews should equal "republished" from R2 (wait a few seconds)
GET http://localhost:8082/admin/read-model/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{admin1}}
